      "source": "Obtain the <a href=\"MessageListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>MessageListener</code></a> to publish <a href=\"Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>messages</code></a> to.",
