    {
      "source": "The actual <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> sent to the <a href=\"MessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>MessageListenerContainer</code></a>. This wrapper type allows passing\nin <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>additional information</code></a> to the Container which can be used for creating the actual\n<a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Task</code></a> running. <br/>\nThe <a href=\"MessageListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>MessageListener</code></a> provides the callback interface when pushing <a href=\"Message.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>messages</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实际发送到<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a>的包装类型，该类型允许向容器传递<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>附加信息</code></a>，这些信息可用于创建实际运行的<a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>Task</code></a>。<br/>\n<a href=\"MessageListener.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>MessageListener</code></a>提供了推送<a href=\"Message.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>消息</code></a>时的回调接口。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Options for specifying the behaviour of the <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a>.",
